nerships for  you know and i think uh um  i hope that this  this is a window of opportunities where  finally ukrainian business and the isn't  the focus  all we need is funds  we would need some technology and that's  it the rest we can do ourselves we're  very clever and hardworking nation  believe me  so what future then do you see for  ukrainian businesses including your own  going forward  well  i'm optimist during all my life  during all the crisis we had and in the  developing market you cannot survive if  you're not an optimist  so anyway i love my country i believe in  it i believe in its future and it's  sincere with all my heart so the the the  future is  there and  i think hard work will will bring us any  future we wish  yulia kirianov thank you very much thank  you  you
 

